    "created_at": "2015-09-03T07:31:44Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-09-03T07:31:44Z",
    "body": "Neither Google nor Mozilla are under pressure, I can assure you. They both consider this feature problematic, as should be evident from their (public) debates.\n\nThe editors have push access. See near the end of https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/acknowledgements.html#acknowledgments for a list. And we could change this back, except we won't as we are agreed about this.\n",
