    "created_at": "2015-09-15T06:01:57Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-09-15T06:01:57Z",
    "body": "Browser vendors are actively removing `<keygen>`, the feature is broken by design, and has poor interoperability. Even if the editors did favor it, that would not change the status quo.\n",
